    out property <string> link: "M14 8 L16.6 5.4 A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 21.6 10.4 L19 13 M10 16 L7.4 18.6 A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 2.4 13.6 L5 11 M8.5 15.5 L15.5 8.5";
